---
source: crates/zaun/src/cli.rs
expression: cmd.render_help().to_string()
---
Print the sandbox a launch would use

Usage: zaun sandbox print [OPTIONS] <GAME>

Arguments:
  <GAME>  The game

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  Output format [default: args] [possible values: args, json, explain, shell]
  -v, --verbose...       Increase log verbosity (-v debug, -vv trace)
      --kind <KIND>      Session kind [default: game] [possible values: game, prepare]
  -h, --help             Print help (see more with '--help')
